
  vacti pentest appliance

  This system runs the vacti engine. It is INERT without a valid vacti
  enrollment: it cannot run an engagement without a live, operator-minted
  enrollment token, the per-engagement trust-gated skill bundle, and the
  control plane. No credentials or methodology are stored on this image.

